5,1,1,talk,Servas,,I have lived long enough to know that silence breeds resentment. Let us speak plainly about what this house truly costs us.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree, Servas. The tension around money is already affecting how we talk to each other. Let’s address it openly before it gets worse.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I just want to know if the old split is still fair. It feels a bit strange now that more people live here.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I’m not ready to commit to a new number yet. I need to see exactly where the money goes before I agree to anything.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m a bit worried about who has to keep track of all this. It takes a lot of time, and I don’t want it to fall on just one person.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, your worry is wise. A system that burdens one soul is a system destined to fail. We must share the weight.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, I hear you. I’m worried the tracking itself is causing the friction. Let’s look at how much time it actually takes.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Daisuke, I agree. It is hard when one person has to do all the checking. I hope we can find a way that is easy for everyone.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Daisuke, fair point. But I’m more worried about the actual cost. I need to see the real numbers before we talk about who does the math.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,Thank you for listening. I just want to make sure the new system doesn’t become a heavy burden for anyone.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Minato, fairness is not just about numbers, but about how we feel in our own spaces. Let us seek a balance that respects both.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Minato, you’re right. The old split doesn’t fit our current lives. I want to understand the actual usage so we can stop guessing and start being fair.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,"@Midori, yes. I just want to know if some people use much more than others. It feels unfair if we all pay the same.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, I’m not sure if usage is the whole story. I need to see the yearly totals to know if the winter spike is really that bad.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Minato, I think you’re right. If some people use much more, it feels unfair. I just want to make sure the new way is easy for everyone.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,"@May, wisdom lies in seeing the whole year, not just the cold months. Let us look at the statements to understand the true rhythm of our costs.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,"@May, I understand your caution. Let’s look at the actual statements to see the real yearly pattern before we decide anything.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minato,,"@May, I agree. Seeing the whole year helps. I also want to check if some rooms use much more power than others.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,"@Servas, I appreciate the wisdom, but I need the raw data. I’m choosing the last twelve utility statements and the electrician's quote to see the real costs and setup fees.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I’m choosing the monthly settle observed at another house and the trial run of a reconciliation template. I need to see how much time it really takes.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
