35,2,1,talk,Servas,,"- **Servas**: I found that two rooms lack sun and need heat early, yet rooms were assigned by lot. This imbalance is a quiet injustice we must correct.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,"I found the statements show wild swings, and the cooler notice proves we avoid shared costs to dodge arguments. We need a system that stops this friction.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,"I checked the rooms. One uses four times more power than another. Also, some rooms are cold, but we got them by luck.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"@Servas, @Midori, @Minato, your findings are interesting, but I have the hard numbers. February hit 29,400 yen, August was 9,100. No two months are close. Metering costs 34,000 yen per room.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Midori"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I found the monthly settle takes forty minutes, and the year-end template means keying in every invoice. It is a lot of work.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, those numbers are stark. Yet, I saw a house where fixed rates meant no one hesitated to warm their home. Comfort should not be a calculation.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@May, that 34,000 yen per room is a huge upfront cost. I worry it will just create new arguments about who pays for the installation.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, four times is a lot. I feel sad that some rooms are so cold. I hope we can fix this gently.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Midori, I hear you, but I need to know if the upfront cost is worth it. @Minato, four times is huge. I’m still weighing the 34,000 yen against the winter spikes.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Midori, forty minutes a month is manageable, but the year-end template is too heavy. I worry it will swallow someone’s evenings.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, forty minutes is a small price for peace. But if the year-end work is too heavy, we must find a lighter path.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, I agree. The year-end work sounds exhausting. I worry it will just create more stress for whoever has to do it.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Daisuke, I am sorry it is so much work. I do not want anyone to be tired. Maybe we can find a way that is easier for everyone?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"@Daisuke, forty minutes is fine, but the year-end template is a nightmare. I refuse to spend my evenings doing that.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@May, I agree. I don’t want to be the one doing that heavy work. We need something simpler that doesn’t take all my time.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,"@Minato, the lot was a cruel joke. I saw a house where fixed rates let people live without fear. We must choose comfort over calculation.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,"@Servas, I agree. The cooler incident shows we are already avoiding shared costs to keep the peace. We need a system that removes that fear, not just the math.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,"@Servas, I am glad you said that. I do not want anyone to be cold. I hope we can find a way that is kind to everyone.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"@Servas, comfort is nice, but 170,000 yen upfront is not. I need a system that doesn’t bankrupt me before winter even starts.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Servas, I agree. I just want a system that is easy to keep running. I don’t want to spend my evenings doing heavy math.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
